//    and increase damage/range/speed.
// 5. Design a new map with branching paths.
//
// 6. ROBOT BRIDGE: the targeting system (find nearest in range,
//    rotate to face, fire) is the same as a turret robot.
//    The pathfinding is A* — same algorithm your maze_solver uses.
